. extent = reserve-extent
    - store.fill-layers
    - store.nodes[row].fill-layers
    - layers.length
    - VectorDocumentFillLayer()
for index in 0 .. < layers.length
    store.fill-layers[(extent.start as Index) + index] = VectorDocumentFillLayer
        - layers[index].color
        - layers[index].visible
store.nodes[row].fill-layers = extent
store.nodes[row].paint-authored = store.nodes[row].paint-authored /or/ vector-document-authored-fill
refresh-paint(row)
maybe-compact()

────────────────────
+ do set-stroke
